\newlabel{fig:pca-static-global-site}{{10}{16}{Global-scaled static terrain--soil PCA of validation supports. PCA inputs are elevation, slope, aspect components, TWI, HLI, accumulation and SLGA soil properties. Colours identify sites and arrows show the dominant loadings, so the figure describes how the retained validation sites occupy different terrain--soil covariate space before any residual overlay is added}{figure.10}{}}
